-- Link's Awakening (Nintendo Switch): what's in the dungeons. Chests (maps,
-- compasses, keys, Stone Beaks, items, rupees), Owl Statues, mini-bosses,
-- bosses, Heart Containers and Instruments. Chests are placed from the
-- remake's own map art, the rest by the room they're in; contents follow
-- Zelda Dungeon's Switch walkthrough. Seashells already on the overworld at a
-- dungeon's door move to where they are inside. Credited to account 15 (Jess)
-- where it exists. Harmless to run again: nothing is added twice.


